|---|---|---|---|
| `KR1` | `r ≤ 2` | `2/3` | `2(a-b)/3` |
| `KL2L3` | `2 ≤ r ≤ 17/7` | `L2 = L3` | `L2` at the kink |
| `KL3F1A` | `2 ≤ r`, `p ≥ 0` | `L3 = F1` | `2b(3b-a)/(5b-a)` |
